  message: "Fixed + merged (selfh/dev 038d4c4a3a). Compact now strips usage_contexts (spec-mandated, §966) + sketch_precomputed (internal artifact, §707) via a _COMPACT_STRIP_KEYS constant applied to both selection branches. RESCOPED from the item's literal statement: validation_report + analysis_runs are DELIBERATELY preserved in compact (ADR-0033/ADR-0043 finalize provenance/quality signals, locked by test_compact_preserves_validation_report_and_consistency in hypergumbo-lang-mainstream) — only the tiered view drops all four. The item conflated those signals with the strippable heavy blocks; the full affected-set validation surfaced the conflict. Behavioral evidence: new test asserts compact strips {usage_contexts, sketch_precomputed} + keeps {analysis_runs, validation_report} across both branches; finalize roundtrip + tiered-omits tests both green; 3405 affected tests pass; core 100%. Wave-4 crush item 2."  # 2907
